-nyx/angular-profile marks MFA enrolment unavailable when no hosted action URL is configured"},{"id":"12","name":"@stynx-nyx/angular-profile reports hosted action configuration errors to the standard error banner"}]}},"thresholds":{"break":85,"high":85,"low":75}}
